<title>NETHERLANDS: Rodamco 1996/97 net higher than forecast.</title>
<headline>Rodamco 1996/97 net higher than forecast.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Feb 28, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Provisional net/shr (gldrs)	 2.81 vs   2.80</p>
<p>    Provisional total net profit    447    vs 446</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		   2.80 vs   2.80</p>
<p>    Positive property revaluation    79    vs  42</p>
<p>    Exchange rates gains		505    vs  45 charge</p>
<p>    Net rental income		   512    vs 460</p>
<p>NOTE - Rodamco NV, the property arm of the Robeco group of investment funds, previously said it expected the 1996/97 full-year net to be slightly lower than in 1995/96.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
